nmexec (1.0.21) stable; urgency=medium

  * Depend on opencv-python-headless instead of opencv-python, so the console scripts start in containers without libGL
  * Relax the Pillow (no upper bound) and numpy (<2.4) pins so nmexec installs on Python 3.14; albumentations<1.4.0 and setuptools<82 are kept

 -- Luis Enrique Dalmau Coopat <ldalmau@sorba.ai>  Fri, 23 Oct 2026 14:00:00 -0400

